### 16.6 Styling Approaches

**1. Plain CSS**

```jsx
import "./Button.css";
<button className="btn btn--primary">Go</button>
```

**2. CSS Modules (scoped, recommended)**

```css
/* Button.module.css */
.btn { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; }
.primary { background: #2563eb; color: white; }
```

```jsx
