<button className={`${styles.btn} ${styles.primary}`}>Go</button>
```

**3. Inline styles**

```jsx
<div style={{ display: "flex", gap: "1rem", color: "red" }} />
// kebab-case → camelCase
```

**4. Tailwind**

```jsx
